OL,3,GNEWSAVote aims to end council deadlock
OL,4,
OL,5,FA leaderless council facing the threat
OL,6,Fof government intervention could
OL,7,Ffinally end weeks of political
OL,8,Fdeadlock.
OL,10,FOldham councillors will vote on
OL,11,FWednesday on proposals to split
OL,12,Fresponsibilities across political
OL,13,Fgroups.
OL,15,FIt follows a series of failed attempts
OL,16,Fto form an administration after no
OL,17,Fparty won an overall majority at May's
OL,18,Flocal elections.
